# Live Lirih round on Ethereum Sepolia, OPEN for contributions until
# 2026-08-05T01:34:00Z. Deliberately the open one rather than the settled one:
# a settled round is a read-only artefact, and this page is worth far more when
# you can actually donate to it, decrypt your own contribution, and top up the
# matching pool yourself.
#
# The SETTLED round, with the finished QF result — the whale raises 4.5x more
# money and earns zero — is 0x4f15c2a627e3f8e866a83fc57f3aa0897ad47399. Point
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ROUND at that instead to look at completed allocations and the
# arithmetic check.
#
# Both run the contract as of this branch, and share the same two tokens.
NEXT_PUBLIC_ROUND=0x6cc49586e37d1d0d53c6836d76db0f38c280f5de
NEXT_PUBLIC_CUSDC=0x763da807dd237053fc4f7aaef0e128fbcf37756b
NEXT_PUBLIC_MUSDC=0x4e41423064e8baca5df7e651bd29c9a25c98d24f
NEXT_PUBLIC_RPC=https://ethereum-sepolia-rpc.publicnode.com
